guide forever/alliance/dwarf-gnome/01-dun-morogh
title Dun Morogh
faction Alliance
race Dwarf,Gnome
levels 1-13
zone Dun Morogh
next forever/alliance/02-westfall

# Route: the simulator's consensus route for the Dwarf start; Gnomes share it.
# One visit, levels 1 to about 12.3, no grind stops.
#
# Flow: Coldridge Valley -> Kharanos (bind) and Steelgrill's Depot -> the
# Grizzled Den and Gretchen's camp -> Rumbleshot -> Brewnall Village and
# Frostmane Hold -> back east to Kharanos and the depot -> Misty Pine
# Refuge -> Amberstill Ranch and the
# Gol'Bolar Quarry -> North Gate Outpost -> hearth to Kharanos -> Brewnall ->
# South Gate Outpost -> Farsen above the quarry -> Old Icebeard's cave ->
# Ironforge (training) and the tram to Stormwind.
#
# Order changes against the export:
# - Felix's parts and the Mornbrew errand (3361, 3364, 3365) are finished
#   before leaving Coldridge Valley instead of walking back for Nori.
# - Scalding Mornbrew Delivery (3364) is taken from Nori with "The Stolen
#   Journal" (218) and run straight to Anvilmar: Durnan's Scalding Mornbrew
#   (10439) vanishes after five minutes (ItemSparse DurationInInventory
#   300 s), and the walk to Durnan is 1:05 by the addon's travel planner
#   (travel route), about a minute in a recorded run. Taken on the first
#   visit, it went cold during the troll cave and Grik'nir. Grik'nir comes
#   after Anvilmar, so the journal and "Bring Back the Mug" (3365; Nori's Mug
#   does not expire) are handed in on one visit to Grelin's camp.
# - "Grund and Gozwin" (97277, from level 4) is done from Anvilmar while still
#   in the valley and handed in on the way south to the troll cave, and "The
#   Adventurer" (96628) is taken from Thalos on the way out, so the route no
#   longer returns to Coldridge after Rumbleshot. The level 4 spells are
#   trained in Anvilmar first: with them the Snow Leopard Prowler (level 6)
#   is safe at level 4 for every class (done before leaving Coldridge on
#   every Dwarf and Gnome class in the beta; recorded on a Gnome Mage and a
#   Dwarf Rogue, about 3 minutes each).
# - Supplies to Tannok (2160) is taken from Hands Springsprocket at the
#   tunnel when you leave Coldridge Valley, beside Thalos, not on the first
#   trogg hunt: about 250 yards out of the way there, 20 at the tunnel.
#   0.010 h sooner to 10 and to 20 under the simulator.
# - The Kharanos and depot pickups are grouped: the simulator shuttled between
#   them several times. Beldin's "A Visitor to Dun Morogh" (96408) is taken at
#   the depot on the way east after Brewnall instead of from the quarry.
# - The Shimmerweed for "The Perfect Stout" is gathered around Brewnall after
#   the hearth, where the simulator also did it.
# - Quest chains now follow their prerequisites (QuestieDB 1.0.6): each
#   follow-up is taken after the prerequisite's turn-in.
#   - "Secure the Mountain" 98323 after 98319 (Cornelius), at Gretchen.
#   - Father Gavin: 99160 and 99162 after "Finding Warmth" (99159), 99161
#     after 99160.
#   - "Stolen Blasting Powder" 95214 after the Empty Powder Keg (95213), at
#     Thesten.
#   - "Nip 'Em in the Bud" (96390) after "Farsen's Watch" (96392).
# - "Beer Basted Boar Ribs" (384) is taken from Ragnar on arrival in
#   Kharanos, before the cooking lesson: on Forever he offers it to
#   characters without Cooking too (seen in game; QuestieDB's Forever store
#   lists no skill, only pfQuest's Classic data lists Cooking).
#
# Left out: "The Reports" (291) and "Stout to Kadrell" (414) are accepted by
# the route but never turned in (the route goes to Westfall, not Ironforge's
# senator or Loch Modan).
# "The Adventurer" (96628) is taken from Thalos once "Senir's Observations"
# (282) is handed in, and handed to Eric before "The Great Outdoors" (96608),
# which it leads to: taken after it, Thalos no longer offers it.
# "The Quarry's Smith" (95217) is optional: Frast Dokner offers it to
# blacksmiths (QuestieDB lists Blacksmithing), and its Copper Bars come from
# smelting Copper Ore or the trade vendors. The new export drops it.
# Your Package Has Arrived (97263, level 2) is an optional errand in
# Ironforge before the tram: a misplaced package by the Tinker Town mailbox
# goes to Eldrun Stormbreaker, the shaman trainer, north of the Great Forge.
# Not taken: Old Ironforge Incursion (96393), Farsen's follow-up to the Dark
# Iron Map (96391), is a level 16 group quest in the Hall of Thanes dungeon,
# and so are The Restless Dead (96394) and Important Heirlooms (96403) from
# Ironforge; come back with a group. Data Hoarders (95041) starts from Jemma
# Quikswitch in Ironforge and wants punch cards from the snowdrifts by
# Gnomeregan, at the far west end of the route: the route reaches Ironforge
# only on the way out.
# Class quests, as class-only steps:
# - Warlock (Gnome): Beginnings (1599, Summon Imp) in Coldridge Valley; The
#   Slaughtered Lamb (1715) from Lago Blackwrench in Ironforge; on arrival in
#   Stormwind, Gakin, Surena Caledon at the Brackwell Pumpkin Patch in Elwynn
#   and The Binding (1688, 1689, Summon Voidwalker).
# - Shaman (Dwarf): Call of Earth (94373-94375) in Coldridge Valley; Call of
#   Fire (94449, 94465-94468) from Kharanos through Bruegs Kindleborn's cave
#   by the South Gate and Braldir Ashmantle in Loch Modan, at about 11-12.
# - Hunter (Dwarf): Etched Rune (3108) to Thorgas Grimson at Anvilmar;
#   Grif Wildheart's taming quests (6064, 6084, 6085: Tame Beast) at
#   Kharanos after the hearth; Training the Beast (6086) in Ironforge.
# - Paladin (Dwarf): the Tome of Divinity quests (2999 to 1785, Redemption)
#   at the end: Ironforge, Narm Faulk by Helm's Bed Lake, Ironforge.
# - Priest: Desperate Prayer (5637, Dwarf; handed in at the Cathedral of Light
#   on arrival in Stormwind) and Confounding Flash (94824, Gnome; Ironforge) from
#   Maxan Anvol in Kharanos.
#   Forever rewords Desperate Prayer to name High Priest Rohan in Ironforge;
#   the quest data still has Laurena in Stormwind take it, so the route keeps
#   her.
# - Priest: In Favor of the Light / Garments of the Light (5626, 5625) reward
#   a robe, not a spell: not taken.
# - Warrior: the Defensive Stance quests (1638, 1639, 1640, 1665) on arrival
#   in Stormwind by the tram, instead of the Vejrek detour from Ironforge.
# - Mage (Gnome): Glyphic Memorandum (3114) in Anvilmar; Mirror Lake (1861)
#   from Jennea Cannon on arrival in Stormwind, its water taken on the ride to
#   Westfall and handed in at the 02-westfall Stormwind stop. Speak with Bink
#   and the Mage-tastic Gizmonitor (1879, 1880) are not taken: Bink is in
#   Ironforge at the end and the toolbox lies back by Gnomeregan.
# - Rogue: their level 10 quests reward items, not spells: not taken.
#   Rogues: see the Class guide Blade of Cunning (Alliance).
# - Shaman (Dwarf): Archaic Rune (98581) from Sten Stoutarm to Teo
#   Hammerstorm in Anvilmar.
# - Shaman, not taken: Call of Water (94494-94505) runs from Ironforge to
#   Loch Modan, the Wetlands, Redridge, Ashenvale and Westfall, places the
#   route reaches years apart in levels; Call of Air (94789, Arathi) and the
#   33-40 chain are Class guides too: forever/class/shaman/call-of-water-alliance
#   and call-of-air-alliance. Earth Sapta (94472), Fire Sapta (94473) and Call
#   of Earth from Eldrun Stormbreaker (96243, a level 10 pointer to Teo for
#   Shamans who skipped 94373) are not needed on the route.
# - Level 1 class letters are taken: every class's letter from Sten Stoutarm
#   (Dwarf 3106-3110 and 98581, Gnome 3112-3115 and 98574) goes to its
#   trainer inside Anvilmar once Dwarven Outfitters is handed in.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Coldridge Valley

step Sten Stoutarm
  tip You start in front of Anvilmar, the stone hall at the north end of the valley. Sten Stoutarm waits outside the door.
  accept 179                                  -- Sten Stoutarm

step Young wolves
  tip Ragged Young Wolves roam the snow just south of Anvilmar.
  collect 750 quest 179                       -- Tough Wolf Meat

step Anvilmar
  turnin 179                                  -- Sten Stoutarm
