# The troll cave's mouth, marked in game at 26.93,80.03 (PR #16); Wowhead
# Classic comments put it "@ 26, 79", Grik'nir "in the cave @ 30, 80"
# (https://www.wowhead.com/classic/npc=808).
step Grund and Gozwin
  tip Grund Drokda stands by Felix at the door of Anvilmar. Gozwin's camp is in the hills just north-west; the Snow Leopard Prowler prowls around it.
  accept 97277                                -- Grund Drokda
  collect 277976 quest 97277                  -- Gozwin's Mechanic's Log, in the camp
  kill 269075 quest 97277                     -- Snow Leopard Prowler
  turnin 97277                                -- Grund Drokda
  goto 26.93,80.03 live "The troll cave"

step Grik'nir the Cold
  tip Grik'nir the Cold is inside the troll cave east of Grelin's camp, not on the hill above it: go in at the mouth and follow the tunnel to the back.
  collect 2004 quest 218                      -- Grelin Whitebeard's Journal

