  collect 264356 quest 94373.1 only Shaman    -- Iceclaw Bear Pendants, from the Frostmane Troll Whelps on the slopes above the camp

step Call of Earth
  only Shaman
  tip Back to Teo Hammerstorm in Anvilmar. He gives you the Earth Sapta: take the rubble-marked path that climbs west from the south of the valley to the Spirit Stone on the ridge, drink the Sapta beside it and speak to the Minor Manifestation of Earth, then bring its Rough Quartz back to Teo.
  turnin 94373                                -- Teo Hammerstorm
  accept 94374
  use 6635 @25.0,62.4                         -- Earth Sapta, beside the Spirit Stone
  turnin 94374                                -- Minor Manifestation of Earth
  accept 94375
  turnin 94375                                -- Teo Hammerstorm: Stoneskin Totem and your Earth Totem

step The tunnel
  tip Mountaineer Thalos guards the tunnel out of the valley, east of Anvilmar; Hands Springsprocket stands beside him at its mouth.
  turnin 282                                  -- Mountaineer Thalos
  accept 420
  accept 96628                                -- Mountaineer Thalos
  accept 2160                                 -- Hands Springsprocket

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Kharanos

step Kharanos
  tip Follow the road through the tunnel and north-east to Kharanos. Kill the Crag Boars on the way: their ribs drop before you have Ragnar's quest and count toward it. Senir, Eric and his campfire are outside the Thunderbrew Distillery. Tannok, Maxan and Ragnar are inside. Tharek Blackstone works the forge.
  turnin 420                                  -- Senir Whitebeard
  turnin 2160                                 -- Tannok Frosthammer, in the distillery
  sethome "Thunderbrew Distillery"
  train class
  accept 400                                  -- Tharek Blackstone
  accept 99158                                -- Maxan Anvol
  accept 384                                  -- Ragnar Thunderbrew
  accept 98322                                -- Senir Whitebeard

step The Great Outdoors
  tip Sit by Eric's campfire (type /sit) and wait for the buff, then Gremlock Pilsnor in the distillery teaches you cooking.
  turnin 96628                                -- Eric Brighthammer: The Adventurer
  accept 96608                                -- Eric Brighthammer
  complete 96608
  turnin 96608
  accept 96629
  complete 96629                              -- Speak with Gremlock Pilsnor
  turnin 96629                                -- Gremlock Pilsnor

step Steelgrill's Depot
  tip Follow the road north-east from Kharanos to the depot below the Ironforge road.
  turnin 400                                  -- Beldin Steelgrill
  accept 317                                  -- Pilot Bellowfiz
  accept 313                                  -- Pilot Stonegear
  accept 5541                                 -- Loslor Rudge

step Boars and bears
  tip Crag Boars and Young Black Bears roam the fields around Kharanos and the depot. Buy the Rhapsody Malt from the innkeeper in the distillery.
  collect 2886 quest 384.1                    -- Crag Boar Rib
  buy 2894 x1 npc 1247                        -- Rhapsody Malt, from Innkeeper Belm in the distillery
  collect 769 quest 317.1                     -- Chunk of Boar Meat
  collect 6952 quest 317.2                    -- Thick Bear Fur

step Kharanos
  turnin 384                                  -- Ragnar Thunderbrew
  accept 98321                                -- Tognus Flintfire

