step Fire Tar and the Reagent Pouch
  only Shaman
  tip Stonesplinter Seers (level 13) stand among the troggs in the south of Stonesplinter Valley, south of Braldir; Tunnel Rat Geomancers (level 12) work the Silver Stream Mine at the north end of the loch. The troggs come in packs and some throw from range: pull one at a time.
  collect 6652 quest 94466.1                  -- Reagent Pouch: Stonesplinter Seers
  collect 5026 quest 94466.2                  -- Fire Tar: Tunnel Rat Geomancers

step The Fire Spirit Stone
  only Shaman
  tip Braldir gives you the Fire Sapta. Climb to the peak above his camp, drink the Sapta beside the Spirit Stone and defeat the Minor Manifestation of Fire, then place its Glowing Ember in the Brazier of the Dormant Flame, atop the Shrine of Eternal Flame.
  turnin 94466                                -- Braldir Ashmantle
  accept 94467
  use 6636 @31.9,64.5                         -- Fire Sapta, beside the Spirit Stone
