# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Ironforge

step The Tome of Divinity
  only Paladin
  zone Ironforge
  tip Follow the road up to Ironforge and take the Mystic Ward: Brandur Ironhammer, Tiza Battleforge and Muiredon Battleforge are in the Hall of Mysteries. John Turner, a beggar, wanders the city. He asks for ten Linen Cloth: the troggs and trolls of Dun Morogh drop it, and the Auction House sells it.
  accept 2999                                 -- Brandur Ironhammer
  turnin 2999                                 -- Tiza Battleforge
  accept 1646                                 -- From the Tome of Divinity she gives you
  turnin 1646
  accept 1647
  turnin 1647                                 -- John Turner
  accept 1648
  collect 2589 quest 1648.1                   -- Linen Cloth
  turnin 1648
  accept 1778
  turnin 1778                                 -- Tiza Battleforge
  accept 1779
  turnin 1779                                 -- Muiredon Battleforge
  accept 1783

