  only Paladin
  zone Dun Morogh
  tip Ride back out of Ironforge and east along the road to Helm's Bed Lake. Narm Faulk lies dead by its shore: use the Symbol of Life on him. The Dark Iron Spies sneaking around the lake carry the script.
  complete 1783                               -- Use the Symbol of Life on Narm Faulk
  turnin 1783                                 -- Narm Faulk
